The next residual is another impossible abstract-frame branch, this time from generic module/local map remainders. Since the target invocation always has the initial module frame and one ordinary `find_zero` frame, I’m tightening both while circularities to that exact reachable configuration and initializing `center` once so the local-map shape is invariant across iterations.
