The bridge mismatch is now localized: its summary index was an existential `NumSeq` recoverable only through an inverse relation, which ordinary rewriting does not synthesize. I’m replacing that relation with a guarded, structural inverse over the already-bound `ValSeq`; this keeps the bridge domain exactly numeric lists and makes the connection to the proved `NumSeq` theorem explicit.
