The failed handoff confirms one more staging detail: after expansion terminates, the continuation first exists as a packed source `Stmts` sequence; only then does the fixed semantics expose the second `#while` head. I’m recording that two-step transition as a tiny generic reachability claim so no loop body is accidentally executed during composition.
