All structural pieces now close independently with `#Top`: arbitrary mixed numeric lists, unbounded expansion, the exact handoff, and unbounded bisection. The decomposition is compositional—the post-state of each claim is byte-for-byte the pre-state of the next—so I’m moving to concrete LLVM execution and validation probes.
